    "quote": "Let $\\delta \\in (0, 1)$, set $\\eta, \\lambda$ as in \\Cref{theorem:confidence-sequence} and $\\alpha = \\Theta\\big( \\sqrt{d} \\:(C \\vee 1)^{-1} \\big)$. Under \\Cref{assumption:m,assumption:link-function,assumption:bound}, \\texttt{HCW-GLB-OMD} attains the following regret upper bound with probability at least $1 - \\delta$: $\\widetilde{\\gO}( d \\sqrt{ \\sum_{t=1}^T g(\\tau_t) \\dmu_{t,\\star}} + d ( 1+ \\kappa) (C\\vee1) + d^2 g_{\\max} \\kappa )$."
   },
